@startuml runbook-market-round
title A market — one dry plot watered through a round
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam titleFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11

participant "Bidder (grower)" as G
participant "Host (supplier)" as H
participant "Valve" as V

note over G : its plot is believed Dry,\nit holds no valve
G -> H : call, on the host's inbox
H -> G : round offered, lot and reserve
G -> H : tender, at its value per litre
H -> G : round cleared, a claim won
G -> H : claim presented
H -> V : dose command
V --> G : next reading: plot Moist
@enduml
